  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-03-14T11:33:09.435Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Allright, i have the issue which might affected a few players. It's not reported much, that is why.\nStill, i want make a report about it. \nI already solved the problem and it was caused by incorrect saved data files, or the data files are possible damaged.\nI wiped the VRChat map on Locallow part fully (the place where VRChat logs are saved) and i can see photos are finally correct saved on drive.\nStill, i really hope VRChat should have some check functions to remove incorrect data files and make sure everything is good. Especially after many patches, something will change, and there is chance data is not more correct and can break sometimes the functions.\nIt means even you heard clearly camera clicked, nothing happens on drive, no images saved.\nSo if you cannot save photos on drive, delete the VRChat map in /Locallow, start again and it will good with new fresh data.\nNo need to full reinstall VRChat, because it will not wipe old data automatic.",
